From 4ab02e0cf1db08608f257899ec4206577059d407 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:20:32 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preserve non-success receipts when pending human
 requests are archived

Emit request_withdrawn atomically only for blocked cards with a human_request. Ordinary archive stays silent. Withdrawal never grants approval or establishes completion. Keep unloaded subscriptions until durable acknowledgement so failed persistence retries.

Proof: RED receipt and unloaded failed-write tests. Hub GREEN: 36 regression tests, 8 expanded controls, final 23 gateway/TUI tests. Three killed mutants: status conjunct, request conjunct, receipt emission. Remote replica publication is unchanged.
---
